CompileTimeError: d42_the_top_of_a_body_comes_before_code.jern:3:5, line 3 column 5
 3 |     requires $a at_least 1
   |     ^^^^^^^^
 what: `requires` goes at the top of a body, before any code
 why:  the top of a body says `labels`, `defaults`, `requires` and `ensures`, before any code (D42, standard 5.3)
